y applies the `x_astro_path` path override when the token matches the current build's route table. This replaces the previous `x-vercel-isr` header check.\n- Strips the internal `x_astro_path` and `x_astro_path_token` params from the URL before rendering, so they never reach user code.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Updates the ISR route-generation assertions to expect the new token param (normalized to a placeholder, since it's a random per-build value).\n- Adds `_isr` entrypoint tests covering the override being ignored without a valid token, ignored when only `x-vercel-isr` is set, and applied when the valid token is present.\n\n## Docs\n\n- No docs update needed. The token and ISR routing params are internal implementation details with no public API change.\n","labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-13T19:09:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T20:14:36Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T20:14:34Z","merged_at":"2026-07-13T20:14:34Z","merge_commit_sha":"3a43cf0f3690a8e33cb30109bc5165611cf38fcd","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"withastro:vercel-isr-path-hardening","ref":"vercel-isr-path-hardening","repo":{"id":348060227,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNDgwNjAyMjc=","name":"astro","full_name":"withastro/astro","owner":{"login":"withastro","id":44914786,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjQ0OTE0Nzg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44914786?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/withastro","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/withastro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/withastro/following{/other_user}","gists